  <metadata>
    <id>sonos-controller</id>
    <version>90.0.77070</version>
    <title>Sonos Controller S2</title>
    <authors>Sonos</authors>
    <owners>foo.li systeme + software, felix schwenk</owners>
    <licenseUrl>https://www.sonos.com/support</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://www.sonos.com/support</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://assets.sonos.com/care/kb/images/FAQ4786/SonosS2.png</iconUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Take total control of your home listening experience with the Sonos app. Play, control and explore your music, your way. Built for mobile, tablet and desktop, the Sonos app connects you to all the music on earth, all over your home. Version up to 11.x is Sonos Controller S1, beginning with 12.x it is Sonos Controller S2.</description>
    <summary>Sonos Desktop Controller</summary>
    <releaseNotes>Update to 90.0.77070. The installer is now fetched from the version-pinned URL on update-software.sonos.com; the previous www.sonos.com/redir/controller_software_pc2 shortlink is bot-protected and returns HTTP 403 to non-browser clients, which broke installation of earlier package versions.</releaseNotes>
    <language>de-LI</language>
    <tags>sonos audio streaming</tags>
  </metadata>
</package>
